##########################################################################################
# The first set of lines (DITHER-1-V) corresponds to exposures at the center position:
# (RA, DEC) = (23:26:00.00, -5:00:00.0) (hh:mm:ss.ss, +dd:mm:ss.s),
# with filter V and exposure times 90 seconds.
#
# The second set of lines (DITHER-2-V) corresponds to the exposures
# with the same filters and exposure times to the first set,
# but at a new position (RA,DEC) = (23:18:00.00, -7:00:00.0).
# 
# The third, fourth, and fifth sets of four lines (DITHER-3/4/5-V) correspond to the exposures
# at the dithered positions to 
# (RA,DEC) = (23:20:00.00, -3:00:00.0), (23:34:00.00, -7:30:00.0), 
# and (23:36:00.00, -3:30:00.0), respectively.
#
# After finishing the above five sets of exposures,
# the script returns to the center position and start the exposures again.
###########################################################################################


# First set of the exposures at the center position (RA,DEC) = (23:26:00.00, -5:00:00.0).
# It consists of exposure with V filter and 90-second exposure time.
#
# Note that the line labeled "DITHER-1-V"  is the line number 1,

 # PROJID  LABEL       RA           DEC           COPT  IMGTYP  OBJECT   FILTER  EXPTIME  UTOBS  UTTOL    # comments

   ANU_FIELD    DITHER-1-V  23:26:00.00  -5:00:00.0   -     object  obj1   V       90       -      -        


# Second set of the exposures at the (RA,DEC) = (23:18:00.00, -7:00:00.0).

 # PROJID  LABEL       RA           DEC           COPT  IMGTYP  OBJECT   FILTER  EXPTIME  UTOBS  UTTOL    # comments
      
   ANU_FIELD    DITHER-2-V  23:18:00.00  -7:00:00.0   -     object  obj2   V       90       -      -        
   


# Third set of the exposures at the position (RA,DEC) = (23:20:00.00, -3:00:00.0).

 # PROJID  LABEL       RA           DEC           COPT  IMGTYP  OBJECT   FILTER  EXPTIME  UTOBS  UTTOL    # comments
     
   ANU_FIELD    DITHER-3-V  23:20:00.00  -3:00:00.0   -     object  obj3   V       90       -      -          


# Fourth set of the exposures at the northeast position (RA,DEC) = (23:34:00.00, -7:30:00.0).

 # PROJID  LABEL       RA           DEC           COPT  IMGTYP  OBJECT   FILTER  EXPTIME  UTOBS  UTTOL    # comments
   
   ANU_FIELD    DITHER-4-V  23:34:00.00  -7:30:00.0   -     object  obj4   V       90       -      -          


# Fifth set of the exposures at the southeast position (RA,DEC) = (23:36:00.00, -3:30:00.0).

 # PROJID  LABEL       RA           DEC           COPT  IMGTYP  OBJECT   FILTER  EXPTIME  UTOBS  UTTOL    # comments
     
   ANU_FIELD    DITHER-5-V  23:36:00.00  -3:30:00.0   -     object  obj5   V       90       -      -          


# Go back to the line number 1 ("DITHER-1-V" in this script) and start the loop again.
# Note that this loop is infinite --- therefore, the operator should stop the loop manually.

 +ostart 1   


# Usually, additional messages to the operator are given as comments at the end of the script as follows.
# They include the desired operation period and how many loops one should perform, etc.

## NOTE: Start at the the evning twilight - Finish when the LMC can be detected by the KMTnet (after about 4 hours, 
## when the HA of LMC is -4.5h)) 

 
# EOF
